From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Kopco <hey@oddcelot.dev>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:15:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] io, crash_handler, spawn_sys, uws_sys: compile on wasm

bun_js_parser reaches these through bun_crash_handler. Stubs only: the waker reports ENOSYS, the parent-death watchdog is a no-op, crashes abort, and socket/process types use local wasm definitions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
